  "description": "XAMHIE crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/m. Reported CIF formula moiety: C114 H166 N8 O26 Tb6,C3 H7 N1 O1,1.5(C2 H3 N1),0.5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb1D (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2A (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb3A (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb4? (Tb) has 0 O neighbors; Tb5? (Tb) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 13 pairs, 3 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.434-4.757 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 74.98-170.34°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb6(TBC[4])2O2(OH)3.32Cl0.68(HCO2)2(DMF)8(H2O)0.5]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 3 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 0 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
